sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as Mobile UI
  participant Draft as Local Draft Store
  participant Queue as Offline Queue
  participant Loop as Sync Loop
  participant API as Backend API

  User->>UI: Edit draft
  UI->>Draft: saveLocalDraft(...)
  UI->>Queue: enqueueOfflineOp(...)
  Loop->>Queue: flushOfflineQueue(token)
  Queue->>API: execute next op
  alt success
    API-->>Queue: 2xx
    Queue->>Queue: remove op
  else failure
    API-->>Queue: error
    Queue->>Queue: increment attempts + persist lastError
    Queue->>Draft: markLocalDraftError(...)
    Note right of Queue: stop on first failure to preserve order
  end
